The Methodist Church in Bodie was built in 1882. [Flying Dawn Marie](w1) and [Amateur Traveler](w3) both give that date. They also say it is the only church still standing in the town. A Catholic church was built the same year but burned down in a 1928 fire, according to [Flying Dawn Marie](w1).

The church is on Fuller Street in Bodie. It is listed in the places database as "Methodist Church" (ref W172226765).

